          "pWrong": 0.21
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Sett:Mordekaiser:2",
          "text": "Do not walk in a straight line past Mordekaiser's range. Death's Grasp pulls you in, so side-step it.",
          "refs": [
            {
              "kind": "champion",
              "key": "Mordekaiser",
              "start": 36,
              "end": 47
            },
            {
              "kind": "ability",
              "key": "Mordekaiser-E",
              "start": 57,
              "end": 70
            }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.29
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Sett:Mordekaiser:3",
          "text": "Take a hit first, then cast Haymaker. The Grit you stored becomes a shield and adds damage.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Sett-W", "start": 28, "end": 36 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.3
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Sett:Mordekaiser:4",
          "text": "Do not trade into a fresh Indestructible shield. Wait until it fades, then use Knuckle Down to go in.",
          "refs": [
            {
              "kind": "ability",
              "key": "Mordekaiser-W",
              "start": 26,
              "end": 40
            },
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Sett-Q", "start": 79, "end": 91 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.67
        }
      ],
      "opponent": "Mordekaiser",
      "comboRefs": []
    },
    {
      "lane": "top",
      "inputHash": "11deab9675a16b5ec0ec64cb17fa7a031bf8d43c5a63a0c1e89c5013fcd9930a",
      "tips": [
        {
          "id": "top:Sett:Rumble:0",
          "text": "Close in with Knuckle Down for the speed, then punch twice; the bonus damage is based on Rumble's max health.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Sett-Q", "start": 14, "end": 26 },
            { "kind": "champion", "key": "Rumble", "start": 89, "end": 95 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.48
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Sett:Rumble:1",
          "text": "Take a few hits, then use Haymaker; the damage you took becomes a shield and extra damage. Aim it so Rumble stands in the center for true damage.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Sett-W", "start": 26, "end": 34 },
            { "kind": "champion", "key": "Rumble", "start": 101, "end": 107 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.91
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Sett:Rumble:2",
          "text": "Use Facebreaker when Rumble has a minion or ally on the other side so both sides get hit and he is stunned.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Sett-E", "start": 4, "end": 15 },
            { "kind": "champion", "key": "Rumble", "start": 21, "end": 27 },
            { "kind": "keyword", "key": "stunned", "start": 99, "end": 106 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.6
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Sett:Rumble:3",
          "text": "Step out of Electro Harpoon's line; two hits slow you a lot and lower your Magic Resist.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Rumble-E", "start": 12, "end": 27 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.09
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Sett:Rumble:4",
          "text": "Go in when Rumble overheats, since he can't cast spells for a few seconds.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "champion", "key": "Rumble", "start": 11, "end": 17 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.01
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Sett:Rumble:5",
          "text": "Leave the burning trail of The Equalizer quickly; staying in it costs a lot of health.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Rumble-R", "start": 27, "end": 40 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.06
        }
      ],
      "opponent": "Rumble",
      "comboRefs": []
    },
